   "hookable": "already-hook",
   "anchor": "class FontData (Borrowed constructor, destructor, member mBorrowed)",
   "notes": "Category is other rather than spoof: it lends the bundled font bytes (owned by StealthBundleFontList) to each face instead of copying the file per face, and no page-observable value changes. A borrowed FontData does not free its bytes; they must outlive every face, which holds only because the bundle cache is immortal (StealthBundleFontList leaks the list on purpose). Moved here from FTUserFontData in gfx/2d/2D.h and its CloneFace in gfx/2d/Factory.cpp on 2026-10-29: Firefox 159 removes FTUserFontData, while FontData.h is unchanged from 157 to 159.",
   "verifier": {
    "changed": [],
    "why": "Written with the move; the bundle path now goes through Mozilla's FTUserFontData(FontData*) and its unchanged CloneFace."
   }
